/test/output
/node_modules
CLAUDE.md

# The golden fixture harness compiles into a temp copy of the tree; these only appear
# if the CLI is pointed at a fixture directly, and must never be committed — the frozen
# v3/ trees are the baseline.
/goldenFixtures/*/*/Velvet Lattice/
/goldenFixtures/*/*/Loom/Review/
# Same hazard for the pathological fixture: its harness compiles into a temp copy, so an
# out/ tree here only appears if the CLI was pointed at the fixture directly.
/__tests__/fixtures/pathological/*/out/

# The .skill bundle is a zip of skill/aid-codex-loom/ — a build output, not source.
# Regenerate it before uploading; the unpacked tree is the thing to edit.
/skill/*.skill
